          "text": "What wonderful memories you have of Panama! ❤️ Scuba diving in San Blas, playing basketball with the island kids, and enjoying lobster while watching the sunset at Rio Mar sound like truly unforgettable experiences. It's those special moments and connections with local people that make a place feel like home.",
